msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was what I was going to do, for the both of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était ce que j’avais prévu de faire, pour notre bien à tous les deux."

#: scenario8:scenario8_376A60ED_5AF4_4493_BD48_753A76E488D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
