msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_005B5F1F_C71A_4678_AD29_DA3A195F7FBF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I rushed down to Morgana’s cottage and told her what was happening, to which she "
"responded with a quizzical tilt of her head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me précipitai donc en courant vers la chaumière de Morgana et lui dis ce qui se passait, "
"ce qu’elle accueillit d’un hochement de tête plus que dubitatif."

#: scenario8:scenario8_AEB4FC83_52A8_4E43_82A7_67CD09FD4FB1
