msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C1A282BC_921B_4A9C_B1F2_F20130E9C7FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I tossed the arm—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s arm—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the man had given me into the lake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je jetai le bras au loin —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ le bras de Morgana que l’homme m’avait donné —⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫ dans le lac."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e20d98e3af1f907e498f34c5eed96d82eb1fcef045e30f0a02b48e9616a846b
#. default-sha256: 6f7c8129517b6e89d49f8d343a5c9698af4e342703ce04c651fb01973c33a8ba
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I tried to convince myself it was all a dream—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫some terrible nightmare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"but I could still feel the warmth of her skin fresh on my hands,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’essayai de me raisonner, de me persuader que tout cela n’était qu’un rêve —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ un "
"terrible cauchemar —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ mais je sentais encore la chaleur de sa peau sur mes mains,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0e7c4ba184af6ffb33d453f6de463570d063d832a101c2c44d32c43f415b7c7
#. default-sha256: 817c7b6d8edaf23f8d5b1a5fb320c9caa8f8d373a648ab968cb208385f0e5ba3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mind couldn’t keep up with the flood of thoughts and emotions and images. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted "
"to close my eyes, but I was too afraid I would find the bloodbath in the cottage on the back of "
"my eyelids,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon esprit n’arrivait pas à suivre le rythme du flux de pensées, d’émotions et d’images qui "
"l’envahissaient. ⟪k:1⟫Je voulais fermer les yeux mais j’avais trop peur de retrouver le bain de "
"sang de la chaumière derrière mes paupières,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5acf865e2a6ce2e5a226d8138b9fe6430b50c4db591cb4e385349293351a7015
#. default-sha256: 9495de7b1537c9835ec8637479de713c3c05aee7d881a9935e59eaded4aac693
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I didn’t want to admit it was my fault...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t want to accept that I had "
"caused it..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais je ne voulais pas admettre que c’était de ma faute...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je refusais d’accepter "
"que j’en étais la cause..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_416CD908_EF6D_4F8D_9FF2_8B9BE9D51255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06b205c6ac0d7ae749775e7d75404cbcc618739f787edb851f791bf7605fb48d
#. default-sha256: b755617a546754654e6668e5bdcdf9dfb140e3b1ad15598459bf8b991f5fb6a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_416CD908_EF6D_4F8D_9FF2_8B9BE9D51255"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By the time I had gotten all the blood off my clothes, the sun was beginning to set."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le temps que j’enlève tout le sang qu’il y avait dessus, le soleil commençait à se coucher."

#: scenario8:scenario8_39FDDD52_4D88_4EB6_9B4C_96CDCEAB2723
