msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At some point, though, all that money I’d been given started running low. ⟪k:1⟫If I’d "
"thought about it for two seconds, I would have seen it coming;"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais à un moment donné, tout l’argent qu’on m’avait donné vint à manquer. ⟪k:1⟫Si j’y avais "
"prêté attention un seul instant, je l’aurais vu ⟪k:2⟫venir ;"

#: scenario8:scenario8_ABD643F9_9E81_43AE_822E_53471C2F8D3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
